; Transactions whose two-commodity balance finalize() accepts through
; the implicit exchange of Phase 3, possibly with the lot-price gain
; of Phase 6.  Each rejected counterpart has its own
; implicit-exchange-*.test.

commodity B
    format 1000.00 B

; Opposite signs: converted at the rate the residual implies.
2024/01/01 Opposite signs
    Assets:Fx:A      $100
    Assets:Fx:B      -80 EUR

; Same signs, top posting first: the doubled cost-side residual
; 0.002 B rounds to zero at the precision of B.
2024/01/02 Same signs, negligible
    Assets:Tiny:X       1 A
    Assets:Tiny:Y    0.001 B

; A lot price in a third commodity is not a conversion rate.
2024/01/03 Lot price in a third commodity
    Assets:Lot:S     10 AAPL {40.00 EUR}
    Assets:Lot:C    $-500

; A lot price in the other commodity: the Phase 6 gain vanishes
; because the price agrees with the residual.
2024/01/04 Lot price agrees
    Assets:Agree:S    10 MSFT {$50}
    Assets:Agree:C   $-500

; Two lots of one base priced in different commodities.
2024/01/05 Lots priced in different commodities
    Assets:Split:S    28 XYZ {$11}
    Assets:Split:S    -7 XYZ {40.00 EUR}

; A lot date alone is not a lot price.
2024/01/06 Lot date only
    Assets:Dated:S    10 GOOG [2020/01/01]
    Assets:Dated:T   -10 GOOG

; The top posting's commodity nets to zero; opposite signs balance
; whichever side is converted.
2024/01/07 Top commodity nets to zero
    Assets:Net:A      $100
    Assets:Net:B     $-100
    Assets:Net:C      10 IBM
    Assets:Net:D     -80 CHF

test bal
               $-900
                 1 A
             10 AAPL
             -80 CHF
             -80 EUR
              10 IBM
             10 MSFT
              21 XYZ  Assets
               $-500
             10 MSFT    Agree
               $-500      C
             10 MSFT      S
                   0    Dated
             10 GOOG      S
            -10 GOOG      T
                $100
             -80 EUR    Fx
                $100      A
             -80 EUR      B
               $-500
             10 AAPL    Lot
               $-500      C
             10 AAPL      S
             -80 CHF
              10 IBM    Net
                $100      A
               $-100      B
              10 IBM      C
             -80 CHF      D
              21 XYZ    Split:S
                 1 A    Tiny:X
--------------------
               $-900
                 1 A
             10 AAPL
             -80 CHF
             -80 EUR
              10 IBM
             10 MSFT
              21 XYZ
end test
